  "texts": [
    {
      "text": "This circuit uses a red LED\nto show if a button has been\npressed.\n\nWhen the button is pressed\nthe circuit is completed\nand the LED turns on.\n\nWhen the button is released\nthe circuit is broken and\nthe LED turns off.\n\nThe switch is a manual way\nto turn on and off the LED\nto signal something, it can \nbe replaced with an electronic\nswitch (MOSFET, BJT) to use\na sensing circuit to automatically\nclose and open the switch.",
